{"blocks": [{"type": "paragraph", "text": "こんにちは田村真佑です"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://www.nogizaka46.com/files/46/diary/n46/MEMBER/moblog/202512/moba9SpUN.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "今日で2025年が終わりますよ〜\n色んなことがある一年だったけど\n自分の可能性をたくさん感じたし\n嬉しいことも悔しいこともあったけど\n乗り越えて今があると思えば\nどれもかけがえの無い出来事だったなと思います"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "今の私があるのは皆さんのおかげですよ"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "ありがとう"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "そしてちょっと自分自身も頑張れたからかな？って思えた年でした"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "本当にありがとね"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "みんな今年もよく頑張ったね"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "わたしもよく頑張りました"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "お疲れ様！"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://www.nogizaka46.com/files/46/diary/n46/MEMBER/moblog/202512/mobk8B79x.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://www.nogizaka46.com/files/46/diary/n46/MEMBER/moblog/202512/mobhsJkcu.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "だいすきだよ"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "2026年もよろしくね"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "最後まで読んでくれてありがとう"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "またね"}], "source": "official"}